<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina sells 50,000 T wheat to Algeria-trade.</title>
<headline>Argentina sells 50,000 T wheat to Algeria-trade.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine exporters sold 50,000 tonnes of wheat to Algeria at $169 CIF for December to January delivery, traders said.</p>
<p>They also said France had sold 100,000 tonnes to Algeria at between $186 and $188 CIF for November to December in trades in recent days.</p>
<p>-- Jason Webb, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655</p>
